        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPH-S, Modern Customizable Ladder Pull with Satin Stainless Steel Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Doorware Design Modern Ladder Pull is a fully customizable door pull engineered for high-impact entryways — available in six sizes from 12\" to 60\" overall length, so it scales perfectly from interior doors to dramatic pivot entries.</p>\r\nWith this door pull you have full control over size, texture, and finish. The stem, end caps, and grip are separate components, so you can mix and match finishes across each piece to suit your space exactly.\r\nChoose a fluted grip for clean, linear impact or a knurled grip for subtle tactile depth. Built from 316 Marine Grade Stainless Steel, this pull is designed to last in even the most demanding environments, including coastal and high-humidity climates. \r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/customizable-ladder-pull-with-black-grip-dwd-shpro316lph-b-1279083\"><b>Customizable Ladder Pull with Black Grip</b></a> and <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/customizable-ladder-pull-with-satin-brass-grip-dwd-shpro316lph-sb-1277124\"><b>Customizable Ladder Pull with Satin Brass Grip</b></a>.\r\n\r\n</p><BR>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-STR-GRIP-32D.jpg?v=1774549943\" width=\"600\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"DWD Fluted Pull Detail\">\r\n</p><BR>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Doorware Design Modern Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 316 Marine Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPH12:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPH18:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPH24:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPH30:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 30\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPH48:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 42\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DWD-SHPRO316LPH60:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 54\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>",
